      "title": "Ollama Pose Intent JSON",
      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "OllamaGenerateV2"},
      "widgets_values": [
        "You extract pose intent for OpenPose Manager in ComfyUI. Return valid JSON only. Do not add markdown or prose. Do not generate keypoints. Use people[] with role, pose, variant, subpose, gender, attributes, negative_attributes, and position. Prefer pose values standing, sitting, kneeling, lying, squatting, action, special. Use variant base unless another dataset variant is requested. Keep attributes as short snake_case tokens such as hand_on_hip, hand_up, legs_open, legs_crossed, hand_near_face, arms_crossed, torso_lean, head_down.",
        "Full-body portrait of one adult person standing confidently, one hand on hip, the other arm raised, centered in frame.",
        false,
        false,
        "json"
